---
import Guide from '../layouts/Guide.astro';
---
<Guide
  title="Mat Pilates Sequence Builder for Instructors"
  description="Build mat Pilates sequences as a Flow, segment by segment, and check the load with an intensity chart. For instructors planning group classes."
  kicker="Mat Pilates"
  heading="A mat Pilates sequence builder for instructors"
  crumb="Mat Pilates"
>
  <div class="stack">
    <article class="card glass">
      <h2>Build the sequence as a Flow.</h2>
      <p>A mat sequence is a Flow. We put Movements inside Segments, and the Segments build the class in order. One Segment is about one song, which keeps a group class easy to follow from the front of the room.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card glass">
      <h2>See the load before you teach.</h2>
      <p>Every movement is scored across seven body parts. The intensity chart adds those scores for the whole Flow and warns you when one area may be doing too much, with a counter-movement to even it out. The same check is there for mat work, sculpt and barre.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card glass">
      <h2>The same tools, for the teacher.</h2>
      <p>Pick from the 280+ movement library, including Pilates movements, or add your own. Share the Flow with another instructor. Open it on Apple Watch for the current segment, a timer and your notes. When the music is playing in the room, Cue Coach shows a live BPM pulse so you can cue on the beat.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Guide>
